Example.Why:
This works because: (1) the plan appears first with all 6 deliverables;
        (2) every heading has a word count and the total is verified explicitly;
        (3) the keyword appears in 6 of 8 H2s (75%, exceeding the 40% threshold);
        (4) the LSI list has 4 clusters; (5) FAQs are genuine search queries, not
        heading restatements; (6) all 3 external links are non-competing with
        rationale; (7) no internal critique trail is exposed in the default output.

PROMPT_TESTING.ValidationCriteria:
Ready for use when: all four tests pass; keyword density is >= 40% of H2s in
every generated outline; word count totals are exact in every generated outline;
FAQs are never simple restatements of existing headings.
